  "description": "Put a proper icon on a Dataverse table: pick one from six bundled icon libraries, and the tool uploads and publishes it. Searches Fluent, Phosphor, Lucide, Tabler, Font Awesome and Solar icons, writes the SVG web resource, points the table at it and publishes, all without leaving XrmToolBox.",
